NOTE 14 was a wrong-sign gloss and is withdrawn per r3 objection 5; the
displayed identity is unchanged and is correct under D27.)*
(ii) *Cross-term vanishing:* for the outgoing `r|R⟩+t|T⟩` at running `t→+∞`,
