`|⟨R|E_W({q_R})|T⟩| ≤ ‖E_W({q_R})|T⟩‖
 = ⟨T|E_W({q_R})|T⟩^{1/2} → 0`,

by Cauchy--Schwarz, since the `T`-leg's window law concentrates on
