### ⟨1⟩9. LEMMA M-IDX-density (density quantization; unconditional)

**ASSUME.** D1 injective tensors `A_α, A_β`; D2(a) covariance with a common
unbroken circle direction `ξ∈𝔥_α∩𝔥_β` and on-site charge `S^z=-iq(ξ)`;
