+
+### ⟨1⟩6. THEOREM M-INDEX-LA-folium (implementer and spectrum)
+
+**ASSUME.**  The exact hypotheses in §0.
+
+**PROVE.**  The conclusion of §0.
+
+**⟨2⟩1.**  Apply ⟨1⟩5 to the projective homomorphism of ⟨1⟩4.  The resulting
